<title>NIGERIA: Mobil Nigeria 9-mth profit falls.</title>
<headline>Mobil Nigeria 9-mth profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Mobil</p>
<p>Nigeria to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	    1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    8,500 vs 9,000</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  1,100 vs 1,500</p>
<p> Taxation		    331.8 vs 546.9</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   785.4 vs 956.3</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
